{"verse_key": "10:100", "surah": 10, "verse": 100, "text_uthmani": "وَمَا كَانَ لِنَفْسٍ أَن تُؤْمِنَ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَيَجْعَلُ ٱلرِّجْسَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَعْقِلُونَ", "translation": "And it is not for a soul [i.e., anyone] to believe except by permission of Allāh, and He will place defilement<sup foot_note=196461>1</sup> upon those who will not use reason.", "verse_from_ms": 2152760, "verse_to_ms": 2168120, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 2152760, "end_ms": 2153720}, {"i": 1, "text": "كَانَ", "start_ms": 2153720, "end_ms": 2154330}, {"i": 2, "text": "لِنَفْسٍ", "start_ms": 2154330, "end_ms": 2155330}, {"i": 3, "text": "أَن", "start_ms": 2155330, "end_ms": 2156070}, {"i": 4, "text": "تُؤْمِنَ", "start_ms": 2156070, "end_ms": 2156830}, {"i": 5, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 2156830, "end_ms": 2157610}, {"i": 6, "text": "بِإِذْنِ", "start_ms": 2157610, "end_ms": 2158400}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 2158400, "end_ms": 2160520}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 2160520, "end_ms": 2162190}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَيَجْعَلُ", "start_ms": 2162190, "end_ms": 2163000}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱلرِّجْسَ", "start_ms": 2163000, "end_ms": 2163370}, {"i": 11, "text": "عَلَى", "start_ms": 2163370, "end_ms": 2164390}, {"i": 12, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 2164390, "end_ms": 2164790}, {"i": 13, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 2164790, "end_ms": 2167635}, {"i": 14, "text": "يَعْقِلُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}